00:00:27.868 --> 00:00:28.901
-Can I say?
-Of course.

00:00:28.901 --> 00:00:30.100
-Oh, okay.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.567
So, he's married to
one of my best friends.

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:33.267
-Oh, okay, good, yeah, yeah.
Of course, yeah.

00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:34.534
We love her, yeah.
-Yeah.

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:35.601
-Yeah, he's a good --

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:37.000
-Tanya.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.901
