"I love that song, too."

00:01:22.033 --> 00:01:24.367
And we couldn't stop playing it.
It was over and over and over.

00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:26.000
Well, Michelle really couldn't.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.601
And, so, we played it
over and over.

00:01:29.601 --> 00:01:32.133
