-Stunning.

00:01:48.033 --> 00:01:49.300
-Stunning.
-Yeah.

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:52.033
So, I mean -- Yeah,
you're lucky she came backstage.

00:01:52.033 --> 00:01:53.234
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

